    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    colourIdx: 1
    dialogue: Shut up! Get the hell off my beach. This is your final warning.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    colourIdx: 0
    dialogue: Aw really? We were just getting to know each other.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    colourIdx: 1
    dialogue: "You don\u2019t know a damn thing, and you never will."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 3
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    colourIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Look I don\u2019t care if it\u2019s a mall or some other junk, whatever
